# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Swahili for the vocabulary that stands beside the lives.

TEXT = {the phrase the index shows: the rendering}. The keys are the phrases
exactly as the index writes them, so a rendering cannot quietly attach itself
to the wrong saint.

A language may later declare PARTS and an expand() to assemble the compound
place-names from pieces rendered once, as the older languages do. It is an
optimisation and not a requirement: everything written in TEXT stands over
whatever expand() builds.
"""
TEXT = {
}

TEXT.update({
    "(Abibus) of Egypt": "(Abibo) wa Misri",
    "(Apphianus) and Edesius (Aedesius) of Lycia": "(Apfiano) na Edesio (Aedesio) wa Lycia",
    "(Eustace) the Confessor, Bishop of Bithynia": "(Eustathio) Mkiri, Askofu wa Bithynia",
    "(Jacob) the Presbyter, and Azadanes and Abdiesus the Deacons, of Persia": "(Yakobo) Kasisi, na Azadanes na Abdieso Mashemasi, wa Persia",
    "(Vadim) of Persia": "(Vadimu) wa Persia",
    "(Voino-Yasenetsky), Archbishop of Simferopol and Crimea": "(Voino-Yasenetsky), Askofu Mkuu wa Simferopol na Krimea",
    "(also called Susanna), New Martyr of Lesbos": "(aitwaye pia Susana), Shahidi Mpya wa Lesbos",
    "(tonsured David and Euphrosyne), Wonderworkers of Murom": "(waliopewa utawa Daudi na Efrosini), Watenda-Miujiza wa Murom",
    "A Cappadocian centurion bowing beneath the sword with his eyes lifted in thanksgiving, the walnut tree of the tradition behind him, the churches of Byzantium rising over his relics.": "Akida wa Kapadokia akiinama chini ya upanga na macho yake yakiwa yameinuliwa kwa shukrani, mti wa kokwa wa mapokeo nyuma yake, makanisa ya Byzantium yakiinuka juu ya masalia yake.",
    "A Celtic hermit of the Devon coast bearing his own severed head to the spring, the robbers behind him, crowned as a martyr among the saints of Britain.": "Mtawa wa Kikelti wa pwani ya Devon akichukua kichwa chake kilichokatwa hadi kwenye chemchemi, wanyang'anyi nyuma yake, akivikwa taji ya shahidi miongoni mwa watakatifu wa Britania.",
    "A Christian general casting down the temples of Galatia, his twelve tribunes and his thousands of soldiers with their wives and children crowned around him, the converted sorcerer Callinicus among them.": "Jemadari Mkristo akibomoa mahekalu ya Galatia, maofisa wake kumi na wawili na maelfu ya askari wake pamoja na wake zao na watoto wao wakivikwa taji kumzunguka, mchawi aliyeongoka Kalinikos miongoni mwao.",
    "A Christian of Alexandria standing before the tribunal to denounce its cruelty, the confession volunteered and the sword received.": "Mkristo wa Aleksandria akisimama mbele ya baraza la hukumu kushutumu ukatili wake, ukiri uliotolewa kwa hiari na upanga uliopokelewa.",
    "A Creole-Aleut priest in vestments holding a Gospel and a cross, against an Alaskan landscape.": "Kasisi wa Kikreoli na Kialeuti amevaa mavazi ya ibada akishika Injili na msalaba, mbele ya mandhari ya Alaska.",
    "A Georgian bishop with a book and a restored church, schoolchildren and monasteries behind him.": "Askofu wa Georgia akiwa na kitabu na kanisa lililojengwa upya, wanafunzi na monasteri nyuma yake.",
    "A Georgian commander marking his forehead with the cross in his own blood, his soldiers crowned around him.": "Jemadari wa Georgia akitia alama ya msalaba katika paji lake kwa damu yake mwenyewe, askari wake wakivikwa taji kumzunguka.",
    "A Georgian monk in prayer before the cave monastery of Gareji in the desert hills.": "Mtawa wa Georgia akisali mbele ya monasteri ya mapango ya Gareji katika vilima vya jangwa.",
    "A Georgian monk-abbot holding a scroll or a book.": "Mtawa na abate wa Georgia akishika gombo au kitabu.",
    "A Georgian prince and commander refusing to trample the icon of Christ before the conqueror, crowned as a great-martyr, the defender of the Georgian faith.": "Mkuu na jemadari wa Georgia akikataa kukanyaga ikoni ya Kristo mbele ya mshindi, akivikwa taji ya shahidi mkuu, mtetezi wa imani ya Georgia.",
    "A Gothic congregation at worship within the burning church, twenty-six crowns rising with the smoke, the queen gathering the holy remains from the ashes.": "Kusanyiko la Wagothi likiabudu ndani ya kanisa liwakalo moto, taji ishirini na sita zikipaa pamoja na moshi, malkia akikusanya masalia matakatifu kutoka majivuni.",
    "A Gothic general of Rome casting down his military belt before Aurelian, seventy soldiers confessing behind him, the river receiving the wonderworking commander.": "Jemadari Mgothi wa Roma akitupa chini mshipi wake wa kijeshi mbele ya Aureliano, askari sabini wakikiri nyuma yake, mto ukimpokea jemadari mtenda-miujiza.",
    "A Great Prince of Kyiv with the churches of Smolensk he raised, the monastic habit he longed for held by an angel, the elder Polycarp pointing him back to his throne.": "Mkuu wa Kyiv akiwa na makanisa ya Smolensk aliyoyajenga, vazi la utawa alilolitamani likishikwa na malaika, mzee Polikarpo akimwelekeza kurudi kwenye kiti chake cha enzi.",
    "A Greek bishop preaching Christ to the pagan Rostov land, the first shepherd of a hostile flock, the see of Rostov founded amid the idols of the north.": "Askofu Mgiriki akihubiri Kristo katika nchi ya kipagani ya Rostov, mchungaji wa kwanza wa kundi lenye uadui, jimbo la Rostov likianzishwa kati ya sanamu za kaskazini.",
    "A Greek iconographer of Constantinople founding the island monastery of Lake Onega, the Sophia icon he copied in his hands, the peoples of the north gathering to his light at the age of one hundred and five.": "Mwandishi wa ikoni Mgiriki wa Konstantinopoli akianzisha monasteri ya kisiwa katika Ziwa Onega, ikoni ya Sofia aliyoinakili mikononi mwake, watu wa kaskazini wakikusanyika kwenye nuru yake akiwa na umri wa miaka mia na mitano.",
    "A Greek metropolitan enthroned at Moscow beside the shrine of Peter, standing unbowed before the khan of the Horde, the Church's charter of freedom in his hand.": "Metropolita Mgiriki akiketishwa Moscow kando ya kaburi la Petro, akisimama bila kuinama mbele ya khani wa Horde, hati ya uhuru wa Kanisa mkononi mwake.",
    "A Greek of Ephesus at the Apostle Paul's side, the Temple riot swirling around his innocent presence, the sickbed of Miletus and the sword of Rome completing his long companionship.": "Mgiriki wa Efeso kando ya Mtume Paulo, ghasia za Hekalu zikimzunguka yeye asiye na hatia, kitanda cha ugonjwa cha Mileto na upanga wa Roma vikikamilisha uandamani wake mrefu.",
    "A Greek prince laying aside his rank for the monastic habit, the Uchma hermitage rising on the bank of the Volga, the exile made a wonderworker in his adopted land.": "Mkuu Mgiriki akiweka kando cheo chake kwa ajili ya vazi la utawa, kijumba cha upweke cha Uchma kikiinuka ukingoni mwa Volga, mhamishwa akifanywa mtenda-miujiza katika nchi aliyopokelewa.",
    "A Patriarch of Constantinople seated upright in death as in blessing, the Mgar monastery of Lubny receiving the traveler, the two worlds of Greece and Rus' joined at his throne.": "Patriaki wa Konstantinopoli ameketi wima katika kifo kama vile katika kubariki, monasteri ya Mgar ya Lubny ikimpokea msafiri, dunia mbili za Ugiriki na Rus zikiunganishwa kwenye kiti chake.",
    "A Persian noble offering his severed members one by one, each with a prayer, angels gathering his prayers.": "Mtukufu wa Persia akitoa viungo vyake vilivyokatwa kimoja baada ya kingine, kila kimoja kwa sala, malaika wakikusanya sala zake.",
    "A Persian soldier turned monk, the captive Cross of the Lord shining before him, the waters and the sword of Bethsaloe beneath his crown.": "Askari wa Persia aliyekuwa mtawa, Msalaba wa Bwana uliotekwa ukiangaza mbele yake, maji na upanga wa Bethsaloe chini ya taji yake.",
    "A Roman centurion kneeling before the Apostle Peter, or vested as a bishop holding a Gospel.": "Akida wa Kirumi akipiga magoti mbele ya Mtume Petro, au amevaa mavazi ya askofu akishika Injili.",
    "A Roman general in armor holding a cross, his soldiers behind him, a spring at his feet.": "Jemadari wa Kirumi katika silaha akishika msalaba, askari wake nyuma yake, chemchemi miguuni pake.",
    "A Roman maiden in flight across the sea with two servants, the convent of Saint Stephen at Mylasa, a cross of stars brighter than the sun above her repose.": "Bikira wa Kirumi akikimbia baharini pamoja na watumishi wawili, monasteri ya wanawake ya Mtakatifu Stefano huko Mylasa, msalaba wa nyota ung'aao kuliko jua juu ya mahali pa mapumziko yake.",
    "A Roman matron refusing the Arian rite, the fire kindled behind her, Saint Ambrose blessing from afar.": "Mama wa Kirumi akikataa ibada ya Kiario, moto ukiwashwa nyuma yake, Mtakatifu Ambrosio akibariki kwa mbali.",
    "A Roman noblewoman scattering deeds and treasure to the poor, thousands of freed slaves behind her, her small cell on the Mount of Olives before her.": "Mwanamke mtukufu wa Kirumi akitawanya hati na hazina kwa maskini, maelfu ya watumwa walioachwa huru nyuma yake, kijumba chake kidogo katika Mlima wa Mizeituni mbele yake.",
    "A Roman senator opening his house to the Apostle Peter, the household at prayer becoming a church, the greeting of the epistle shining over the door.": "Seneta wa Kirumi akifungua nyumba yake kwa Mtume Petro, watu wa nyumbani wakisali wakawa kanisa, salamu za waraka zikiangaza juu ya mlango.",
    "A Roman widow standing amid seven crowned sons, encouraging each to the contest, her own crown descending last.": "Mjane wa Kirumi akisimama kati ya wana saba waliovikwa taji, akimtia moyo kila mmoja kwenye mashindano, taji yake mwenyewe ikishuka mwisho.",
    "A Russian captive in the winter night of Kazan, bound and wounded in the snow, alive at dawn with his confession unbroken.": "Mfungwa Mrusi katika usiku wa baridi wa Kazan, amefungwa na kujeruhiwa katika theluji, yu hai alfajiri na ukiri wake haukuvunjika.",
    "A Russian soldier-slave at prayer in his master's stable, the Turkish household softened by his faith, his incorrupt relics glorified across the Greek world.": "Askari mtumwa Mrusi akisali katika zizi la bwana wake, watu wa nyumba ya Kituruki wakilainishwa na imani yake, masalia yake yasiyooza yakitukuzwa katika ulimwengu wote wa Kigiriki.",
    "A Serbian prince leading his army at Kosovo, choosing the kingdom of heaven over the kingdom of earth, crowned as a great-martyr, his incorrupt relics the treasure of his people.": "Mkuu wa Serbia akiongoza jeshi lake huko Kosovo, akichagua ufalme wa mbinguni kuliko ufalme wa duniani, akivikwa taji ya shahidi mkuu, masalia yake yasiyooza yakiwa hazina ya watu wake.",
    "A Spanish dignitary in the Great Schema, the roads of his pilgrimage from Rome to Jerusalem behind him, the Saracen sword before him.": "Mtukufu wa Hispania katika Shahada Kuu ya utawa, njia za hija yake kutoka Roma hadi Yerusalemu nyuma yake, upanga wa Msarakeni mbele yake.",
})

TEXT.update({
    "A Swedish princess become mother of Rus, her sainted son Vladimir beside her, the crowns of France, Hungary, and Norway among her daughters, the nun's habit her final vesture.": "Binti mfalme wa Uswidi aliyekuwa mama wa Rus, mwanawe mtakatifu Vladimir kando yake, taji za Ufaransa, Hungaria na Norwe kati ya binti zake, vazi la utawa likiwa mavazi yake ya mwisho.",
    "A Syrian stranger standing three days in prayer in the church of Spoleto, the garden thieves fed at his table and converted, the offered estates refused with a smiling shake of the head.": "Mgeni Msiria akisimama siku tatu katika sala ndani ya kanisa la Spoleto, wezi wa bustani wakilishwa mezani pake na kuongoka, mashamba aliyopewa akiyakataa kwa kutikisa kichwa kwa tabasamu.",
    "A Tatar captive baptized and tonsured, founding a monastery on the shore of Lake Kozha in the far north, the wilderness hallowed by his prayer.": "Mateka Mtatari aliyebatizwa na kupewa utawa, akianzisha monasteri ufuoni mwa Ziwa Kozha katika kaskazini ya mbali, jangwa likitakaswa kwa sala yake.",
    "A Yup'ik mother in a kuspuk holding a basin and towel, the northern lights above the tundra behind her.": "Mama Myupiki amevaa kuspuk akishika bakuli na taulo, mwanga wa kaskazini juu ya tundra nyuma yake.",
    "A barefoot ascetic in rags, blessing, at Novgorod.": "Mtawa asiye na viatu katika matambara, akibariki, huko Novgorod.",
    "A barefoot fool in tattered clothing by a northern river, giving away what was given to him.": "Mpumbavu kwa ajili ya Kristo asiye na viatu katika nguo zilizochanika kando ya mto wa kaskazini, akitoa kwa wengine alichopewa.",
    "A barefoot fool-for-Christ holding a head of cabbage, at Novgorod by the river.": "Mpumbavu kwa ajili ya Kristo asiye na viatu akishika kichwa cha kabichi, huko Novgorod kando ya mto.",
    "A barefoot fool-for-Christ in a sheepskin holding an axe, by the river defending the city.": "Mpumbavu kwa ajili ya Kristo asiye na viatu katika ngozi ya kondoo akishika shoka, kando ya mto akiutetea mji.",
    "A barefoot holy fool with long hair, holding a Psalter, of gentle and sorrowful aspect.": "Mpumbavu mtakatifu asiye na viatu mwenye nywele ndefu, akishika Zaburi, mwenye sura ya upole na huzuni.",
    "A basilica at Lydda, the tomb of Saint George within, hierarchs consecrating the church.": "Kanisa kuu huko Lida, kaburi la Mtakatifu Georgi ndani yake, maaskofu wakiliweka wakfu kanisa.",
    "A bearded missionary priest with a traveler's bag, the church of Jackson and the hills of California behind him.": "Kasisi mmisionari mwenye ndevu akiwa na mkoba wa msafiri, kanisa la Jackson na vilima vya California nyuma yake.",
    "A beggar beneath the staircase of his father's palace, unknown to all his household, the finished scroll of his life clasped in his dead hand while the emperor and the pope kneel to read it.": "Mwombaji chini ya ngazi za jumba la babaye, asiyejulikana na yeyote wa nyumbani mwake, gombo lililokamilika la maisha yake likiwa limeshikwa mkononi mwake aliyekufa huku mfalme na papa wakipiga magoti kulisoma.",
    "A bent elder in white on his knees upon the rock, the Theotokos of Tenderness before him, a bear at the edge of the forest clearing.": "Mzee aliyeinama amevaa nguo nyeupe akipiga magoti juu ya jiwe, ikoni ya Mzazi-Mungu wa Upole mbele yake, dubu ukingoni mwa uwanja wa msitu.",
    "A bishop alone in an emptied city awaiting the persecutors, then crucified at Perge, teaching from the cross until his voice failed into glory.": "Askofu peke yake katika mji ulioachwa akiwangoja watesi, kisha akisulubiwa huko Perge, akifundisha kutoka msalabani hata sauti yake ilipokoma kwa utukufu.",
    "A bishop and a presbyter of Persia holding crosses, swords above them.": "Askofu na kasisi wa Persia wakishika misalaba, panga juu yao.",
    "A bishop and a virgin holding crosses, broken books of sorcery burning at their feet.": "Askofu na bikira wakishika misalaba, vitabu vya uchawi vilivyovunjwa vikiwaka miguuni pao.",
    "A bishop and his companions holding crosses, cast into a furnace, a soldier among them.": "Askofu na wenzake wakishika misalaba, wakitupwa katika tanuru, askari mmoja miongoni mwao.",
    "A bishop and presbyter cast into a pit, angels crowning them from above.": "Askofu na kasisi wakitupwa shimoni, malaika wakiwavika taji kutoka juu.",
    "A bishop and theologian of Lycia with the scroll of his Banquet of the Ten Virgins, refuting the errors of Origen, crowned at the last with martyrdom.": "Askofu na mwanateolojia wa Lycia akiwa na gombo la Karamu ya Mabikira Kumi, akikanusha makosa ya Origen, mwishowe akivikwa taji ya shahidi.",
    "A bishop answering the emperor that the Church's questions belong to the Church, the road of exile opening behind him.": "Askofu akimjibu mfalme kwamba maswali ya Kanisa ni ya Kanisa, njia ya uhamisho ikifunguka nyuma yake.",
    "A bishop baptizing an African king, a boy captive and a royal tutor shown in the scenes of his life.": "Askofu akimbatiza mfalme wa Kiafrika, mtoto mateka na mwalimu wa kifalme wakionyeshwa katika matukio ya maisha yake.",
    "A bishop barring the church door to an emperor, a beehive at his feet, a scroll of his hymns in hand.": "Askofu akimzuia mfalme mlangoni pa kanisa, mzinga wa nyuki miguuni pake, gombo la nyimbo zake mkononi.",
    "A bishop before a fallen idol, a demon bearing a great stone altar behind him, hot springs at his feet.": "Askofu mbele ya sanamu iliyoanguka, pepo likibeba madhabahu kubwa ya jiwe nyuma yake, chemchemi za maji ya moto miguuni pake.",
    "A bishop before the burning temple of Marnas, the cross-guardian's keys at his belt, the Good Thief descending from the Cross in his vision, the Eudoxiana church rising over pagan Gaza.": "Askofu mbele ya hekalu la Marnas liwakalo moto, funguo za mlinzi wa msalaba mshipini mwake, Mwizi Mwema akishuka kutoka Msalabani katika maono yake, kanisa la Eudoksiana likiinuka juu ya Gaza ya kipagani.",
    "A bishop before the emperor, pointing to the emperor's son, teaching the honor due the Son of God.": "Askofu mbele ya mfalme, akimwonyesha mwana wa mfalme, akifundisha heshima impasayo Mwana wa Mungu.",
    "A bishop beheaded at the altar in mid-Liturgy, twenty-eight years of tribunals and torments ranged behind him like waves, Agathangelus crowned at his side.": "Askofu akikatwa kichwa madhabahuni katikati ya Liturujia, miaka ishirini na minane ya mabaraza na mateso ikipanga nyuma yake kama mawimbi, Agathangelo akivikwa taji kando yake.",
    "A bishop beholding the ladder to heaven with his predecessor calling from above, one hundred and twenty-eight companions ascending behind him under the Persian sword.": "Askofu akiona ngazi ya kwenda mbinguni na mtangulizi wake akiita kutoka juu, wenzake mia moja na ishirini na wanane wakipanda nyuma yake chini ya upanga wa Persia.",
    "A bishop by night in a plain cloak, leaving firewood at a poor widow's door, his cathedral of Belgorod behind him.": "Askofu usiku katika joho la kawaida, akiacha kuni mlangoni pa mjane maskini, kanisa lake kuu la Belgorod nyuma yake.",
    "A bishop drinking the sorcerer's cup unharmed, the magician kneeling converted beside his cast-down instruments.": "Askofu akinywa kikombe cha mchawi bila kudhurika, mchawi akipiga magoti akiwa ameongoka kando ya vifaa vyake vilivyotupwa chini.",
    "A bishop enthroned with a Gospel, the first hierarch of Jerusalem, of ascetic and venerable countenance.": "Askofu ameketi kwenye kiti cha enzi na Injili, askofu wa kwanza wa Yerusalemu, mwenye sura ya kitawa na ya heshima.",
    "A bishop holding a Gospel, refuting heretics who shrink before his word.": "Askofu akishika Injili, akikanusha wazushi wanaojikunyata mbele ya neno lake.",
    "A bishop holding a page of the alphabet he invented, the sacred birch of the Zyrians felled behind him, the sorcerer Pam turning from the fire and the water, a new people reading the Gospel in its own letters.": "Askofu akishika ukurasa wa herufi alizozibuni, mti mtakatifu wa Wazirian ukiangushwa nyuma yake, mchawi Pam akiukimbia moto na maji, taifa jipya likisoma Injili kwa herufi zake mwenyewe.",
    "A bishop holding a scroll of the Creed, the Theotokos and John the Theologian appearing above, a mountain moved behind.": "Askofu akishika gombo la Kanuni ya Imani, Mzazi-Mungu na Yohane Mwanateolojia wakitokea juu, mlima ukihamishwa nyuma.",
    "A bishop holding an icon of Christ against the imperial decree, the sick healed at his hands.": "Askofu akishika ikoni ya Kristo dhidi ya amri ya mfalme, wagonjwa wakiponywa mikononi mwake.",
    "A bishop holding the book of the Divine Names, the darkened sun of the Crucifixion above him.": "Askofu akishika kitabu cha Majina ya Kimungu, jua lililotiwa giza la Kusulubiwa juu yake.",
    "A bishop in a laborer's tunic drawing water and hauling wood at Nitria, the omophorion of Damascus folded away, heaven alone reading the monk's true rank.": "Askofu katika vazi la mfanyakazi akiteka maji na kubeba kuni huko Nitria, omoforio ya Damasko ikiwa imekunjwa kando, mbingu peke yake ikijua cheo halisi cha mtawa.",
    "A bishop in a mitre holding a crozier, with a gray beard and an ascetic, gentle face.": "Askofu amevaa mitra akishika fimbo ya uchungaji, mwenye ndevu za kijivu na uso wa kitawa na wa upole.",
    "A bishop in monastic poverty, Cernica's island monastery at one hand and the Frasinei he founded at the other, the seminary and the printing press of Ramnic behind him, his face worn bright by fasting.": "Askofu katika umaskini wa utawa, monasteri ya kisiwa ya Cernica upande mmoja na Frasinei aliyoianzisha upande mwingine, seminari na mtambo wa uchapishaji wa Ramnic nyuma yake, uso wake ukiwa umeng'aa kwa kufunga.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion and mantle holding a book, of gentle and humble aspect.": "Askofu katika omoforio na joho akishika kitabu, mwenye sura ya upole na unyenyekevu.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion and sakkos holding a Gospel book, with a Greek-style beard.": "Askofu katika omoforio na sakosi akishika kitabu cha Injili, mwenye ndevu za mtindo wa Kigiriki.",
})

TEXT.update({
    "A bishop in the omophorion blessing the waters at a river confluence, holding a cross.": "Askofu katika omoforio akibariki maji mahali mito inapokutana, akishika msalaba.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion blessing, holding a Gospel, before the cathedral of Tambov.": "Askofu katika omoforio akibariki, akishika Injili, mbele ya kanisa kuu la Tambov.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion holding a Gospel book or the scroll of his Great Canon.": "Askofu katika omoforio akishika kitabu cha Injili au gombo la Kanuni yake Kuu.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion holding a Gospel book, a white dove upon his head.": "Askofu katika omoforio akishika kitabu cha Injili, njiwa mweupe juu ya kichwa chake.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion holding a Gospel, of humble aspect.": "Askofu katika omoforio akishika Injili, mwenye sura ya unyenyekevu.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion holding a Gospel, sometimes with a banner or before a battle.": "Askofu katika omoforio akishika Injili, mara nyingine akiwa na bendera au mbele ya vita.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion holding a Gospel, the cathedral of Saints Cyril and Methodius behind him.": "Askofu katika omoforio akishika Injili, kanisa kuu la Watakatifu Kirilo na Methodio nyuma yake.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion holding an icon and a Gospel.": "Askofu katika omoforio akishika ikoni na Injili.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion surrounded by his ten disciples, all crowned as martyrs.": "Askofu katika omoforio akizungukwa na wanafunzi wake kumi, wote wakivikwa taji ya shahidi.",
    "A bishop in the omophorion, his hands or face marked by charcoal, holding a Gospel.": "Askofu katika omoforio, mikono au uso wake ukiwa na alama za makaa, akishika Injili.",
    "A bishop in the schema and omophorion holding a Gospel, before the city of Voronezh.": "Askofu katika shahada ya utawa na omoforio akishika Injili, mbele ya mji wa Voronezh.",
    "A bishop in the snows of Siberia, a school of native children beside him, the gates of China closed behind.": "Askofu katika theluji za Siberia, shule ya watoto wa kienyeji kando yake, malango ya China yakiwa yamefungwa nyuma.",
    "A bishop laying aside his omophorion at the mouth of a desert gorge, the monastery of Choziba in the cliffs.": "Askofu akiweka kando omoforio yake mdomoni mwa korongo la jangwa, monasteri ya Choziba katika majabali.",
    "A bishop led by an angel from torture to torture and city to city, Sirmium converted behind him and Formia receiving him, the lamps of the sailors burning at his name.": "Askofu akiongozwa na malaika kutoka mateso hadi mateso na mji hadi mji, Sirmio ikiongoka nyuma yake na Formia ikimpokea, taa za mabaharia zikiwaka kwa jina lake.",
    "A bishop of Aegina laying down his omophorion and returning to the monastic habit, his island see behind him.": "Askofu wa Aegina akiweka chini omoforio yake na kurudi katika vazi la utawa, jimbo lake la kisiwa nyuma yake.",
    "A bishop of Amasea standing between the hunted virgin and the tyrant's demand, the sea giving back his body in the fishermen's nets, the last crowns of the persecution descending as the peace of the Church dawns.": "Askofu wa Amasea akisimama kati ya bikira aliyewindwa na dai la mtesi, bahari ikirudisha mwili wake katika nyavu za wavuvi, taji za mwisho za mateso zikishuka wakati amani ya Kanisa inapopambazuka.",
    "A bishop of Argos measuring out grain that does not diminish, the ransomed captives returning from the sea behind him, his monastic family in Christ around the one see he consented to hold.": "Askofu wa Argos akipima nafaka isiyopungua, mateka waliokombolewa wakirudi kutoka baharini nyuma yake, familia yake ya kitawa katika Kristo ikimzunguka katika jimbo pekee alilokubali kulishika.",
    "A bishop of Benevento unharmed in the furnace, the beasts of the arena lying at his feet, Naples receiving his body and his blood, his deacons and companions crowned around him.": "Askofu wa Benevento asiyedhurika katika tanuru, wanyama wa uwanja wamelala miguuni pake, Napoli ikipokea mwili wake na damu yake, mashemasi na wenzake wakivikwa taji kumzunguka.",
    "A bishop of Bithynia holding the icon of Christ and the open Scriptures together, the road of exile behind him.": "Askofu wa Bithynia akishika ikoni ya Kristo na Maandiko yaliyo wazi pamoja, njia ya uhamisho nyuma yake.",
    "A bishop of Bithynia on the road of exile, his cathedral behind him and the icon of Christ unsurrendered before him.": "Askofu wa Bithynia katika njia ya uhamisho, kanisa lake kuu nyuma yake na ikoni ya Kristo isiyosalimishwa mbele yake.",
    "A bishop of Brooklyn with the map of a continent behind him, thirty parishes rising from immigrant streets, The Word in his hand, Tikhon of Moscow laying hands upon the first-consecrated of America.": "Askofu wa Brooklyn akiwa na ramani ya bara nyuma yake, parokia thelathini zikiinuka kutoka mitaa ya wahamiaji, jarida la Neno mkononi mwake, Tikhon wa Moscow akiweka mikono juu ya wa kwanza kuwekwa wakfu wa Amerika.",
    "A bishop of Catania in exile for the holy images, the icon of Christ held fast against the imperial decree.": "Askofu wa Catania uhamishoni kwa ajili ya ikoni takatifu, ikoni ya Kristo ikishikwa imara dhidi ya amri ya mfalme.",
    "A bishop of Chalcedon and his fellow ascetic standing together for the icons, the see of the Fourth Council refusing the new heresy, exile shared as the cell had been.": "Askofu wa Kalkedonia na mwenzake mtawa wakisimama pamoja kwa ajili ya ikoni, jimbo la Mtaguso wa Nne likikataa uzushi mpya, uhamisho ukigawanywa kama ilivyokuwa kwa chumba cha utawa.",
    "A bishop of Chalcedon defending the holy icons, his hand open to the poor, the exile that crowned his confession before him.": "Askofu wa Kalkedonia akitetea ikoni takatifu, mkono wake ukiwa wazi kwa maskini, uhamisho uliovika taji ukiri wake mbele yake.",
    "A bishop of Corinth falsely accused, the newborn infant speaking at his prayer to name its true father, the slander confounded and the saint vindicated.": "Askofu wa Korintho aliyeshtakiwa kwa uongo, mtoto mchanga akisema kwa sala yake ili kumtaja baba yake wa kweli, uzushi ukiaibishwa na mtakatifu akithibitishwa.",
    "A bishop of Cyprus blessing a dry vine-branch that bears fruit before its time, the poor fed at his hand, the idols of the island cast down.": "Askofu wa Kipro akibariki tawi kavu la mzabibu lizaalo matunda kabla ya wakati wake, maskini wakilishwa mkononi mwake, sanamu za kisiwa zikiangushwa.",
    "A bishop of Cyprus crowned with martyrdom, his myrrh-streaming relics borne across the sea to Constantinople, the sick healed at his shrine.": "Askofu wa Kipro akivikwa taji ya shahidi, masalia yake yatoayo manukato yakichukuliwa baharini hadi Konstantinopoli, wagonjwa wakiponywa kaburini pake.",
    "A bishop of Cyprus with the nails of his torture, teaching the faithful gathered at what he thought his end, the edict of Constantine opening his prison to a few more years of shepherding.": "Askofu wa Kipro akiwa na misumari ya mateso yake, akiwafundisha waamini waliokusanyika alipodhani ni mwisho wake, amri ya Konstantino ikifungua gereza lake kwa miaka michache zaidi ya uchungaji.",
    "A bishop of Epirus striking down the great serpent at the poisoned spring, the rain descending on the parched fields at his prayer, a dead man rising from the bier to witness against the false creditor.": "Askofu wa Epiro akimwangusha joka kubwa kwenye chemchemi yenye sumu, mvua ikishuka juu ya mashamba yaliyokauka kwa sala yake, mfu akiinuka kutoka jeneza kushuhudia dhidi ya mdai wa uongo.",
    "A bishop of Melitene serene under the torturers, the emperor's own order opening his prison, the confessor's crown worn through years of peace.": "Askofu wa Melitene mtulivu chini ya watesi, amri ya mfalme mwenyewe ikifungua gereza lake, taji ya mkiri ikivaliwa katika miaka ya amani.",
    "A bishop of Novgorod standing alone against an uncanonical council, the Caves that formed him receiving him in confinement and in death, Theodosius appearing to welcome him home.": "Askofu wa Novgorod akisimama peke yake dhidi ya baraza lisilo la kikanuni, Mapango yaliyomlea yakimpokea katika kifungo na katika kifo, Theodosio akitokea kumkaribisha nyumbani.",
    "A bishop of Pergamum standing where Satan's throne was, the brazen bull glowing behind him, the open Apocalypse naming him the faithful witness in the Lord's own voice.": "Askofu wa Pergamo akisimama pale kilipokuwa kiti cha enzi cha Shetani, ng'ombe wa shaba akiwaka nyuma yake, Ufunuo ulio wazi ukimwita shahidi mwaminifu kwa sauti ya Bwana mwenyewe.",
    "A bishop of Perm baptizing the peoples of the far north, the idols of the Permians thrown down and the churches rising, the mission of Saint Stephen carried onward.": "Askofu wa Perm akibatiza watu wa kaskazini ya mbali, sanamu za Wapermi zikiangushwa na makanisa yakiinuka, utume wa Mtakatifu Stefano ukiendelezwa.",
    "A bishop of Persia with staff of prophecy, a ruined city behind him, two disciples at his side.": "Askofu wa Persia akiwa na fimbo ya unabii, mji ulioharibiwa nyuma yake, wanafunzi wawili kando yake.",
    "A bishop of Pisidian Antioch refusing the iconoclast decree, the icons standing in his churches while he goes into exile, the confessor's crown replacing the surrendered see.": "Askofu wa Antiokia ya Pisidia akikataa amri ya wapinga-ikoni, ikoni zikisimama katika makanisa yake wakati yeye anakwenda uhamishoni, taji ya mkiri ikichukua nafasi ya jimbo alilosalimisha.",
    "A bishop of Prusa destroying a great serpent by the sign of the Cross, preaching Christ under Julian the Apostate, crowned with martyrdom by the sword.": "Askofu wa Prusa akiliangamiza joka kubwa kwa ishara ya Msalaba, akihubiri Kristo chini ya Yuliano Mwasi, akivikwa taji ya shahidi kwa upanga.",
    "A bishop of Prusa standing unharmed in the boiling spring, preaching the God who made both the healing waters and the fire of hell, his three presbyters crowned beside him.": "Askofu wa Prusa akisimama bila kudhurika katika chemchemi ya maji yanayochemka, akihubiri Mungu aliyeumba maji ya uponyaji na moto wa jehanamu pia, makasisi wake watatu wakivikwa taji kando yake.",
    "A bishop of Rome in the omophorion holding a Gospel, with a martyr's palm.": "Askofu wa Roma katika omoforio akishika Injili, akiwa na tawi la shahidi.",
    "A bishop of Rome of the age of the martyrs, shepherding his flock in the catacombs, bringing the noble and the humble alike to the faith of Christ.": "Askofu wa Roma wa zama za mashahidi, akilichunga kundi lake katika makaburi ya chini ya ardhi, akiwaleta watukufu na wanyenyekevu sawasawa kwenye imani ya Kristo.",
    "A bishop of Rostov preaching Christ to the half-pagan land, the idols thrown down and the churches rising, the grace of wonders confirming the word of the Caves-trained shepherd.": "Askofu wa Rostov akihubiri Kristo katika nchi iliyokuwa nusu ya kipagani, sanamu zikiangushwa na makanisa yakiinuka, neema ya miujiza ikithibitisha neno la mchungaji aliyelelewa katika Mapango.",
})

TEXT.update({
    "A bishop of Rostov whose very funeral became a glorification, wonders flowing from his body before burial, the shepherd of the yoke-time honored as a saint from the hour of his death.": "Askofu wa Rostov ambaye mazishi yake yenyewe yakawa kutangazwa mtakatifu, miujiza ikitiririka kutoka mwili wake kabla ya kuzikwa, mchungaji wa wakati wa nira akiheshimiwa kama mtakatifu tangu saa ya kifo chake.",
    "A bishop of Salamis with the five tongues of his learning and the Panarion of his refutations, the ascetic of the Palestinian desert crowned with the long white rule of Cyprus.": "Askofu wa Salamis mwenye lugha tano za elimu yake na Panario la makanusho yake, mtawa wa jangwa la Palestina akivikwa taji ya uongozi wake mrefu wa Kipro katika mvi zake.",
    "A bishop of Samosata refusing to surrender the record of the faith though his hand be cut off, traveling in disguise to strengthen the Orthodox, crowned by the tile of an Arian.": "Askofu wa Samosata akikataa kusalimisha kumbukumbu ya imani hata mkono wake ukatwe, akisafiri kwa kujificha ili kuwaimarisha Waothodoksi, akivikwa taji kwa kigae cha Mwario.",
    "A bishop of Sardis scourged for Christ, the dry wooden stake stained with his blood taking root and growing into a green tree of healing beside him.": "Askofu wa Sardi akichapwa kwa ajili ya Kristo, mti mkavu uliotiwa damu yake ukiota mizizi na kuwa mti wa kijani wa uponyaji kando yake.",
    "A bishop of Synnada bearing the icons he defended, the courts of caliph and emperor behind him, the exile that crowned his confession before him.": "Askofu wa Sinada akibeba ikoni alizozitetea, mabaraza ya khalifa na ya mfalme nyuma yake, uhamisho uliovika taji ukiri wake mbele yake.",
    "A bishop of Tver reconciling princes with the Gospel between them, the Zheltikov monastery rising by the river, the Kyiv Caves Paterikon copied out under his hand.": "Askofu wa Tver akiwapatanisha wakuu na Injili kati yao, monasteri ya Zheltikov ikiinuka kando ya mto, Paterikoni ya Mapango ya Kyiv ikinakiliwa kwa mkono wake.",
    "A bishop of Verona with a fishing rod and a line of catechumens for his catch, the Adige rising in flood behind him and standing like a wall at the open doors of his church.": "Askofu wa Verona akiwa na ndoana ya kuvulia na mstari wa wakatekumeni kama samaki wake, Adije ikifurika nyuma yake na kusimama kama ukuta katika milango iliyo wazi ya kanisa lake.",
    "A bishop of Vladimir with the founding letter of the Caves Paterik in his hand, his friend Polikarp cautioned against vainglory, the Near Caves receiving the author home to the monastery of his heart.": "Askofu wa Vladimir akiwa na barua ya kwanza ya Paterik ya Mapango mkononi mwake, rafiki yake Polikarp akionywa dhidi ya majivuno, Mapango ya Karibu yakimpokea mwandishi nyumbani katika monasteri ya moyo wake.",
    "A bishop of ascetic countenance in the omophorion, blessing, his incorrupt relics in a shrine.": "Askofu mwenye sura ya kitawa katika omoforio, akibariki, masalia yake yasiyooza katika sanduku takatifu.",
    "A bishop of gentle countenance distributing alms, a schema laid ready beside his omophorion.": "Askofu mwenye sura ya upole akigawa sadaka, vazi la shahada ya utawa likiwa tayari kando ya omoforio yake.",
    "A bishop of the Black Sea coast with his city walls behind him, Saracen raiders scattered by his prayer, the northern raiders frozen at his sepulcher until the captives go free.": "Askofu wa pwani ya Bahari Nyeusi akiwa na kuta za mji wake nyuma yake, wavamizi Wasarakeni wakitawanywa kwa sala yake, wavamizi wa kaskazini wakigandishwa kaburini pake hata mateka walipoachwa huru.",
    "A bishop of the Crimean Goths defending the holy icons, consecrated in Orthodox Georgia, sharing the sufferings of his people under the Khazar yoke.": "Askofu wa Wagothi wa Krimea akitetea ikoni takatifu, aliyewekwa wakfu katika Georgia ya Kiothodoksi, akishiriki mateso ya watu wake chini ya nira ya Wakhazari.",
    "A bishop of the Hellespont in chains for the icons, the letters of Theodore the Studite in his hands.": "Askofu wa Helesponti akiwa katika minyororo kwa ajili ya ikoni, barua za Theodoro wa Studio mikononi mwake.",
    "A bishop of the Hellespont on the road again, the iconoclasts' document forever unsigned behind him, the icon of Christ carried from refuge to refuge.": "Askofu wa Helesponti akiwa tena njiani, hati ya wapinga-ikoni ikibaki bila kusainiwa nyuma yake, ikoni ya Kristo ikichukuliwa kutoka kimbilio hadi kimbilio.",
    "A bishop of the Nicene fathers leading the serpent by his staff into the fire, and on the mountain road the ambush of the heretics, the stone of the murderess turned against her until his grave healed her.": "Askofu wa mababa wa Nicea akiliongoza joka kwa fimbo yake motoni, na njiani mlimani uvamizi wa wazushi, jiwe la mwuaji likimgeukia hata kaburi lake lilipomponya.",
    "A bishop of the Siberian frontier among the peoples of the east, the churches and schools of his planting behind him, the lamp of his night prayers burning over Irkutsk.": "Askofu wa mpaka wa Siberia kati ya watu wa mashariki, makanisa na shule alizozipanda nyuma yake, taa ya sala zake za usiku ikiwaka juu ya Irkutsk.",
    "A bishop of the apostolic line blessing a bitter spring at Catania, the water running sweet and the city believing.": "Askofu wa mstari wa kitume akibariki chemchemi chungu huko Catania, maji yakawa matamu na mji ukaamini.",
    "A bishop ordained by the hand of the Theologian, laying his own hand on the young Polycarp, a myrtle flowering from his tomb.": "Askofu aliyewekwa wakfu kwa mkono wa Mwanateolojia, akiweka mkono wake mwenyewe juu ya Polikarpo kijana, mhadasi ukichanua kutoka kaburini pake.",
    "A bishop rapt in divine song at the funeral of the Theotokos, the apostles around the bier.": "Askofu akichukuliwa katika wimbo wa kimungu kwenye mazishi ya Mzazi-Mungu, mitume wakizunguka jeneza.",
    "A bishop rising from a deep pit, the king with the face of a beast healed before him, a church shown from heaven.": "Askofu akiinuka kutoka shimo refu, mfalme mwenye uso wa mnyama akiponywa mbele yake, kanisa likionyeshwa kutoka mbinguni.",
    "A bishop sailing upon his mantle across the lake, the city that expelled him kneeling on the shore.": "Askofu akisafiri juu ya joho lake ziwani, mji uliomfukuza ukipiga magoti ufuoni.",
    "A bishop scourged with ox-hide thongs, the icon of Christ held fast in his hands through four exiles.": "Askofu akichapwa kwa mikanda ya ngozi ya ng'ombe, ikoni ya Kristo ikishikwa imara mikononi mwake katika uhamisho mara nne.",
    "A bishop serene in prison, the false witness healed and confessing, an open book of Ecclesiastes before him.": "Askofu mtulivu gerezani, shahidi wa uongo akiponywa na kuungama, kitabu kilicho wazi cha Mhubiri mbele yake.",
    "A bishop set upon by schismatics with swords, praying for his murderers as he falls.": "Askofu akivamiwa na wafarakano wenye panga, akiwaombea wauaji wake anapoanguka.",
    "A bishop standing unharmed in the flames with the sorcerer bound in his omophorion, the fire dividing the true wonder from the false before the whole city.": "Askofu akisimama bila kudhurika katika miali huku mchawi akiwa amefungwa katika omoforio yake, moto ukitenganisha muujiza wa kweli na wa uongo mbele ya mji wote.",
    "A bishop standing upon his mantle spread on the waters of the Oka, the Murom icon of the Mother of God in his hands, borne upstream to Ryazan, his innocence proclaimed by the wonder.": "Askofu akisimama juu ya joho lake lililotandazwa juu ya maji ya Oka, ikoni ya Mzazi-Mungu ya Murom mikononi mwake, akichukuliwa kinyume cha mkondo hadi Ryazan, kutokuwa na hatia kwake kukitangazwa kwa muujiza.",
    "A bishop struck down at the altar during the Divine Liturgy, angels receiving his soul.": "Askofu akiuawa madhabahuni wakati wa Liturujia Takatifu, malaika wakiipokea roho yake.",
    "A bishop tried by fire, beasts, and sword, the great company of five hundred forty-six confessors about him, Jerusalem's name upon a martyrdom the whole East shared.": "Askofu akijaribiwa kwa moto, wanyama na upanga, kundi kubwa la wakiri mia tano arobaini na sita likimzunguka, jina la Yerusalemu likiwa juu ya mateso ambayo Mashariki yote iliyashiriki.",
    "A bishop upon a pillar with a pen, the paschal sermons streaming from his mouth like light, the prayer book of the faithful open at the prayers he wrote for every day of the week.": "Askofu juu ya nguzo akiwa na kalamu, mahubiri ya Pasaka yakitiririka kinywani mwake kama nuru, kitabu cha sala cha waamini kikiwa wazi kwenye sala alizoziandika kwa kila siku ya juma.",
    "A bishop vested in the omophorion, with a short rounded beard, holding a Gospel book and blessing.": "Askofu amevaa omoforio, mwenye ndevu fupi za mviringo, akishika kitabu cha Injili na kubariki.",
    "A bishop washing the wounds of lepers with his own hands, then standing before Leo the Armenian foretelling his swift destruction, the fortress of his thirty-year exile behind him.": "Askofu akiosha vidonda vya wenye ukoma kwa mikono yake mwenyewe, kisha akisimama mbele ya Leo Mwarmenia akitabiri maangamizi yake ya haraka, ngome ya uhamisho wake wa miaka thelathini nyuma yake.",
    "A bishop who once wore Tatar chains preaching Christ in the Tatar tongue at Kazan, the Savior monastery rising in the kremlin, the sick of two faiths healed at his prayer.": "Askofu aliyewahi kuvaa minyororo ya Kitatari akihubiri Kristo kwa lugha ya Kitatari huko Kazan, monasteri ya Mwokozi ikiinuka ndani ya ngome, wagonjwa wa imani mbili wakiponywa kwa sala yake.",
    "A bishop who was a surgeon, the omophorion over his shoulders and the healing of the sick in his hands, the prisons and exiles of his confession behind him, the light of Christ in a godless age.": "Askofu aliyekuwa daktari wa upasuaji, omoforio mabegani mwake na uponyaji wa wagonjwa mikononi mwake, magereza na uhamisho wa ukiri wake nyuma yake, nuru ya Kristo katika zama zisizomjua Mungu.",
    "A bishop with a Gospel preaching to the people of Volhynia, a cave monastery in the distance.": "Askofu akiwa na Injili akiwahubiri watu wa Volinia, monasteri ya mapango kwa mbali.",
    "A bishop with a company of one hundred ninety-nine disciples, the sign of the Cross that saved him in battle above, the swords of Sicily gathering the whole school into one harvest.": "Askofu akiwa na kundi la wanafunzi mia moja tisini na tisa, ishara ya Msalaba iliyomwokoa vitani juu yake, panga za Sicilia zikikusanya shule nzima katika mavuno moja.",
    "A bishop with a high domed forehead and short pointed beard, a thin ascetic face, vested in the omophorion and holding a Gospel book.": "Askofu mwenye paji pana lililoinuka na ndevu fupi zenye ncha, uso mwembamba wa kitawa, amevaa omoforio na akishika kitabu cha Injili.",
    "A bishop with a lamp, a serpent fleeing before him, the island of Crete behind.": "Askofu akiwa na taa, joka likimkimbia, kisiwa cha Krete nyuma.",
    "A bishop with a long dark tapering beard and high forehead, vested in the omophorion, holding a Gospel book and blessing.": "Askofu mwenye ndevu ndefu nyeusi zenye ncha na paji pana, amevaa omoforio, akishika kitabu cha Injili na kubariki.",
    "A bishop with the Prologue open in his hands, the lake of Ohrid behind one shoulder and the wire of Dachau behind the other, preaching Christ to the peoples in every tongue he knew.": "Askofu akiwa na Prologo iliyo wazi mikononi mwake, ziwa la Ohridi bega moja na waya wa Dachau bega lingine, akihubiri Kristo kwa mataifa kwa kila lugha aliyoijua.",
    "A bishop with the marks of long warfare, demons fleeing behind him, angels and the Theotokos receiving his soul before him.": "Askofu mwenye alama za vita ndefu, mapepo yakikimbia nyuma yake, malaika na Mzazi-Mungu wakiipokea roho yake mbele yake.",
})

TEXT.update({
    "A bishop with the paschal fire blazing on the hill of Slane against the high king's darkness, the shamrock of the Trinity in his hand, the tribes of Ireland kneeling to the font.": "Askofu akiwa na moto wa Pasaka uwakao juu ya kilima cha Slane dhidi ya giza la mfalme mkuu, jani la shamroki la Utatu mkononi mwake, makabila ya Ireland yakipiga magoti kwenye birika la ubatizo.",
    "A bishop with verses branded upon his face, holding an icon of Christ and a scroll of canons.": "Askofu mwenye beti zilizochomwa usoni pake, akishika ikoni ya Kristo na gombo la kanuni.",
    "A bishop writing canons at a desk, the Theotokos appearing to bless him.": "Askofu akiandika kanuni mezani, Mzazi-Mungu akitokea kumbariki.",
    "A bishop's omophorion hidden beneath a novice's habit, an aged hesychast silent in his cell at the Lavra.": "Omoforio ya askofu iliyofichwa chini ya vazi la mwanafunzi wa utawa, mzee hesikasti akiwa kimya katika chumba chake katika Lavra.",
    "A bishop, a deacon, a servant, and a holy woman crowned together amid flames at Pergamum.": "Askofu, shemasi, mtumishi na mwanamke mtakatifu wakivikwa taji pamoja katikati ya miali huko Pergamo.",
    "A bishop-ascetic in chains beneath an iron cage, Saint George leading him from childhood as a companion, the possessed freed and the storms stilled at his prayer, the resigned omophorion folded beside the hermit's cave.": "Askofu mtawa akiwa katika minyororo chini ya kizimba cha chuma, Mtakatifu Georgi akimwongoza tangu utoto kama mwenzake, waliopagawa wakifunguliwa na dhoruba zikitulizwa kwa sala yake, omoforio aliyoiacha ikiwa imekunjwa kando ya pango la mtawa.",
    "A bishop-confessor bearing the marks of his wounds, holding a Gospel.": "Askofu mkiri akiwa na alama za majeraha yake, akishika Injili.",
    "A bishop-envoy on the road between empires, gifts flowing through his hands to the poor of his city.": "Askofu mjumbe njiani kati ya milki, zawadi zikipita mikononi mwake kwenda kwa maskini wa mji wake.",
    "A bishop-martyr barring an emperor from the church doors, three youths and their mother beside him.": "Askofu shahidi akimzuia mfalme milangoni mwa kanisa, vijana watatu na mama yao kando yake.",
    "A bishop-martyr by the sea, ships in the distance, flames beneath his feet trampled down.": "Askofu shahidi kando ya bahari, meli kwa mbali, miali chini ya miguu yake ikikanyagwa.",
    "A bishop-martyr holding a Gospel, a lion at his feet praising God.": "Askofu shahidi akishika Injili, simba miguuni pake akimsifu Mungu.",
    "A bishop-martyr in the omophorion holding a Gospel and a cross.": "Askofu shahidi katika omoforio akishika Injili na msalaba.",
    "A bishop-martyr in the omophorion holding a Gospel or a scroll inscribed against heresy.": "Askofu shahidi katika omoforio akishika Injili au gombo lililoandikwa dhidi ya uzushi.",
    "A bishop-martyr in the omophorion holding a Gospel or a scroll on the unity of the Church.": "Askofu shahidi katika omoforio akishika Injili au gombo juu ya umoja wa Kanisa.",
    "A bishop-martyr in the omophorion holding a Gospel, a burning church in the background.": "Askofu shahidi katika omoforio akishika Injili, kanisa liwakalo moto nyuma.",
    "A bishop-martyr in the omophorion holding a Gospel, sometimes with a ship or flames.": "Askofu shahidi katika omoforio akishika Injili, mara nyingine akiwa na meli au miali.",
    "A bishop-martyr in the omophorion holding a Gospel, with his three companions and tamed beasts.": "Askofu shahidi katika omoforio akishika Injili, pamoja na wenzake watatu na wanyama waliofugwa.",
    "A bishop-martyr with a soldier and four women, all crowned together.": "Askofu shahidi pamoja na askari mmoja na wanawake wanne, wote wakivikwa taji pamoja.",
    "A bishop-martyr with a young nun and two servants, holding crosses.": "Askofu shahidi pamoja na mtawa kijana wa kike na watumishi wawili, wakishika misalaba.",
    "A bishop-physician and his sister holding crosses, his hands extended in healing.": "Askofu tabibu na dada yake wakishika misalaba, mikono yake ikinyooshwa katika kuponya.",
    "A bishop-physician at the Persian court, the king healed and the hidden trickster unearthed from beneath the temple floor, caravans of martyrs' relics entering the city of his name.": "Askofu tabibu katika baraza la mfalme wa Persia, mfalme akiponywa na mdanganyifu aliyejificha akifukuliwa kutoka chini ya sakafu ya hekalu, misafara ya masalia ya mashahidi ikiingia katika mji wa jina lake.",
    "A bishop-physician in a mountain cave with the wild beasts gathered gently around him, a child healed of a choking bone, seven women and two children crowned beside him.": "Askofu tabibu katika pango la mlimani na wanyama wa mwitu wamekusanyika kwa upole kumzunguka, mtoto akiponywa mfupa uliomkaba, wanawake saba na watoto wawili wakivikwa taji kando yake.",
    "A blind eldress seated small and radiant in a Moscow room, the lines of the troubled stretching through the Soviet dark to her door, her closed eyes seeing all of it in God.": "Mzee wa kike kipofu ameketi mdogo na mwenye kung'aa katika chumba cha Moscow, safu za wenye shida zikinyoosha kupitia giza la Kisovieti hadi mlangoni pake, macho yake yaliyofumba yakiyaona yote hayo katika Mungu.",
    "A boy bishop-to-be praying before an emptied granary as it fills again, coins and wine multiplying in his open hands.": "Mvulana atakayekuwa askofu akisali mbele ya ghala tupu nalo likijaa tena, sarafu na divai vikizidishwa mikononi mwake iliyo wazi.",
    "A boy confessing Christ with his tutor Modestus and nurse Crescentia beside him, the cauldron and the beasts before them, the child and his guardians crowned together.": "Mvulana akimkiri Kristo pamoja na mwalimu wake Modesto na mlezi wake Kresentia kando yake, sufuria na wanyama mbele yao, mtoto na walinzi wake wakivikwa taji pamoja.",
    "A boy in peasant dress with a harrow, lightning above, angels receiving his soul.": "Mvulana katika mavazi ya mkulima akiwa na sululu, umeme juu, malaika wakiipokea roho yake.",
    "A boy martyr with a white dove above him, water springing from the rock at his prayer, the lion of his mountain cave refusing to harm him in the arena.": "Mvulana shahidi akiwa na njiwa mweupe juu yake, maji yakibubujika kutoka mwamba kwa sala yake, simba wa pango lake la mlimani akikataa kumdhuru katika uwanja.",
    "A boy prince in royal robes bearing the palm of the passion-bearer, the yard of Uglich behind him where he fell, his incorrupt relics enshrined in the Kremlin to confound the pretenders.": "Mkuu kijana katika mavazi ya kifalme akibeba tawi la mbeba-mateso, uwanja wa Uglich nyuma yake alipoanguka, masalia yake yasiyooza yakiwekwa katika Kremlin ili kuwaaibisha wajidaio.",
    "A bread merchant with pierced hands and feet, walking his last steps for Christ.": "Mfanyabiashara wa mikate mwenye mikono na miguu iliyotobolewa, akitembea hatua zake za mwisho kwa ajili ya Kristo.",
    "A bridegroom and bride in virginal crowns, the lion guarding Daria's honor, the tribune Claudius converted with his whole house, the sand pit of the Via Salaria closing over the two alive.": "Bwana harusi na bibi harusi katika taji za ubikira, simba akilinda heshima ya Daria, ofisa Klaudio akiongoka pamoja na nyumba yake yote, shimo la mchanga la Via Salaria likiwafunika wawili wakiwa hai.",
    "A brother and sister crowned as martyrs, holding crosses and palms.": "Kaka na dada wakivikwa taji ya shahidi, wakishika misalaba na matawi.",
    "A brother and sister martyrs, he upon a tree, she with a spear, both crowned.": "Kaka na dada mashahidi, yeye juu ya mti, naye kwa mkuki, wote wawili wakivikwa taji.",
    "A canonarch of the Far Caves directing the chanting of the brethren, the book of the services in his hand, the monastic life embraced from his childhood.": "Kiongozi wa waimbaji wa Mapango ya Mbali akiongoza uimbaji wa ndugu, kitabu cha ibada mkononi mwake, maisha ya utawa aliyoyapokea tangu utoto wake.",
    "A captain of the guard bound to a tree and shot with arrows, the widow Irene tending him, his converted companions with their crowns around him.": "Jemadari wa walinzi akifungwa mtini na kupigwa mishale, mjane Irene akimhudumia, wenzake walioongoka wakiwa na taji zao kumzunguka.",
    "A cathedral in flames on the night of the Nativity, the bishop baptizing and communing the multitude within, twenty thousand crowns rising in the smoke.": "Kanisa kuu likiwaka moto usiku wa Kuzaliwa kwa Bwana, askofu akibatiza na kuwapa Komunyo umati ndani yake, taji elfu ishirini zikipaa katika moshi.",
    "A centurion striding from the desert into the crowded amphitheater, proclaiming Christ before the astonished city.": "Akida akitoka jangwani kuingia katika ukumbi uliojaa watu, akimtangaza Kristo mbele ya mji uliostaajabu.",
    "A centurion with spear at the foot of the Cross, his eyes lifted to the Crucified, confessing.": "Akida mwenye mkuki chini ya Msalaba, macho yake yameinuliwa kwa Aliyesulubiwa, akikiri.",
    "A church at Nicopolis in Armenia": "Kanisa huko Nikopoli katika Armenia",
    "A church built over his grave at Skepsis": "Kanisa lililojengwa juu ya kaburi lake huko Skepsis",
    "A church in her honor at Chalcedon by 450": "Kanisa kwa heshima yake huko Kalkedonia kufikia mwaka 450",
})

