TEXT.update({
    "Three Egyptian soldiers standing firm before their tribune at Chalcedon, the idol's altar refused, the tortures failing to move their single confession.": "Askari watatu wa Misri wakisimama imara mbele ya jemadari wao huko Kalkedonia, madhabahu ya sanamu ikikataliwa, mateso yakishindwa kuutikisa ukiri wao mmoja.",
    "Three Egyptian travelers seized at the city gate, the fire and the sword before them, the imprisoned confessors they came to serve behind.": "Wasafiri watatu wa Misri wakikamatwa langoni pa mji, moto na upanga mbele yao, wakiri waliofungwa waliokuja kuwahudumia nyuma.",
    "Three Persian brothers in the dress of envoys refusing the pagan sacrifice at the court of Julian, crowned together with martyrdom, the peace they came to make sealed with their blood.": "Ndugu watatu wa Persia katika mavazi ya wajumbe wakikataa dhabihu ya kipagani katika baraza la Yuliano, wakivikwa taji ya shahidi pamoja, amani waliyokuja kuifanya ikitiwa muhuri kwa damu yao.",
    "Three bishops in the omophorion holding Gospels, confessors of the faith.": "Maaskofu watatu katika omoforio wakishika Injili, wakiri wa imani.",
    "Three brothers of one birth bound to one tree in the flames, their aged grandmother crowned beside them, the scribe Neon writing their contest.": "Ndugu watatu wa uzazi mmoja wamefungwa kwenye mti mmoja katika miali, bibi yao mzee akivikwa taji kando yao, mwandishi Neoni akiandika mashindano yao.",
    "Three disciples of the Apostle Andrew bound to stakes in a frozen river, the ice rising about them, crowned with martyrdom in the cold of the north.": "Wanafunzi watatu wa Mtume Andrea wamefungwa kwenye vigingi katika mto uliogandishwa, barafu ikiinuka kuwazunguka, wakivikwa taji ya shahidi katika baridi ya kaskazini.",
    "Three elder priest-martyrs in vestments holding crosses and the Gospel.": "Makasisi watatu wazee mashahidi katika mavazi ya ibada wakishika misalaba na Injili.",
    "Three elders of the caves, one anointing a sick man with oil, the others with eyes raised in vision.": "Wazee watatu wa mapango, mmoja akimpaka mgonjwa mafuta, wengine wakiwa na macho yaliyoinuliwa katika maono.",
    "Three martyrs amid flames, Christ appearing with a host of angels to raise one of them.": "Mashahidi watatu katikati ya miali, Kristo akitokea na jeshi la malaika kumfufua mmoja wao.",
    "Three martyrs bound hand and foot beside the sea, crowned from heaven.": "Mashahidi watatu wamefungwa mikono na miguu kando ya bahari, wakivikwa taji kutoka mbinguni.",
    "Three martyrs holding crosses, Timothy amid flames, Agapius and Thecla with beasts.": "Mashahidi watatu wakishika misalaba, Timotheo katikati ya miali, Agapio na Thekla pamoja na wanyama.",
    "Three martyrs holding crosses, crowned for their contest.": "Mashahidi watatu wakishika misalaba, wakivikwa taji kwa mashindano yao.",
    "Three martyrs holding crosses, crowned together.": "Mashahidi watatu wakishika misalaba, wakivikwa taji pamoja.",
    "Three martyrs of Byzantium confessing Christ before the persecutor, crowned together for their steadfast faith.": "Mashahidi watatu wa Byzantium wakimkiri Kristo mbele ya mtesi, wakivikwa taji pamoja kwa imani yao thabiti.",
    "Three martyrs of Carthage standing unharmed in a dungeon of serpents, the swords of Decius' men completing what the beasts refused.": "Mashahidi watatu wa Karthago wakisimama bila kudhurika katika gereza la nyoka, panga za watu wa Dekio zikikamilisha kile wanyama walichokataa.",
    "Three martyrs of Edessa above a young woman rescued from a tomb, a false-swearing soldier judged below.": "Mashahidi watatu wa Edesa juu ya mwanamke kijana aliyeokolewa kutoka kaburini, askari aliyeapa kwa uongo akihukumiwa chini.",
    "Three martyrs of Persia confessing Christ before the fire-altar, the crowns descending on the confessors of the Church beyond the empire's eastern border.": "Mashahidi watatu wa Persia wakimkiri Kristo mbele ya madhabahu ya moto, taji zikiwashukia wakiri wa Kanisa ng'ambo ya mpaka wa mashariki wa milki.",
    "Three martyrs of the Danube frontier confessing Christ at Noviodunum, the crowns descending on the confessors of ancient Scythia.": "Mashahidi watatu wa mpaka wa Danube wakimkiri Kristo huko Noviodunum, taji zikiwashukia wakiri wa Skithia ya kale.",
    "Three martyrs of the Danube villages standing firm through the night assaults of the enemy, the angel's comfort at midnight, the swords of Dorostolum completing their crowns.": "Mashahidi watatu wa vijiji vya Danube wakisimama imara katika mashambulizi ya usiku ya adui, faraja ya malaika usiku wa manane, panga za Dorostolo zikikamilisha taji zao.",
    "Three martyrs of three ages, an old soldier, a man in his strength, and a youth, crowned amid the arena.": "Mashahidi watatu wa rika tatu, askari mzee, mtu katika nguvu zake, na kijana, wakivikwa taji katikati ya uwanja.",
    "Three martyrs stepping forward from the crowd as the governor sacrifices, swords awaiting them.": "Mashahidi watatu wakitoka mbele kutoka umati gavana anapotoa dhabihu, panga zikiwangoja.",
    "Three martyrs, one in a commander's cloak laying down his belt, his wife standing by in faith.": "Mashahidi watatu, mmoja katika joho la jemadari akiweka chini mshipi wake, mkewe akisimama kando katika imani.",
    "Three martyrs: an orator, an eparch in his robes, and a secretary with his pen, the emperor's sword over them.": "Mashahidi watatu: mnenaji, mkuu wa mkoa katika majoho yake, na katibu na kalamu yake, upanga wa mfalme juu yao.",
    "Three men and a noblewoman led in bonds from city to city, their confession outlasting every tribunal, four crowns descending on the Thracian road.": "Wanaume watatu na mwanamke mtukufu wakiongozwa katika vifungo kutoka mji hadi mji, ukiri wao ukiyapita mabaraza yote, taji nne zikishuka katika njia ya Thrakia.",
    "Three monks of the Palestinian desert fallen beneath the raiders' arrows, their cells behind them and their crowns above, the desert keeping their story and the Church their names.": "Watawa watatu wa jangwa la Palestina walioanguka chini ya mishale ya wavamizi, vyumba vyao nyuma yao na taji zao juu, jangwa likihifadhi hadithi yao na Kanisa majina yao.",
    "Three princes uncovered incorrupt in one tomb at Yaroslavl, the father Theodore great in stature and his sons David and Constantine at his sides.": "Wakuu watatu waliogunduliwa bila kuoza katika kaburi moja huko Yaroslavl, baba Theodoro mkubwa kwa kimo na wanawe Davidi na Konstantino pande zake.",
    "Three servants of the imperial household confessing Christ in the wake of the empress, the prison's hunger and the sword dividing among them one crown.": "Watumishi watatu wa nyumba ya mfalme wakimkiri Kristo baada ya malkia, njaa ya gereza na upanga vikigawana kati yao taji moja.",
    "Three sisters before the judge Dulcetius, the hidden Scriptures at the heart of the charge, Agape and Chionia unscorched in the flames as if asleep, Irene on the mountain summit receiving the arrow on the day of Pascha.": "Dada watatu mbele ya hakimu Dulketio, Maandiko yaliyofichwa yakiwa kiini cha shtaka, Agapi na Kionia bila kuungua katika miali kana kwamba wamelala, Irene juu ya kilele cha mlima akipokea mshale siku ya Pasaka.",
    "Three spearbearers of the emperor casting down their military belts before the throne, the contest of George shining before them, the fire receiving the guard of Caesar for the army of Christ.": "Wabeba-mkuki watatu wa mfalme wakitupa chini mishipi yao ya kijeshi mbele ya kiti cha enzi, mashindano ya Georgi yakiangaza mbele yao, moto ukiupokea ulinzi wa Kaisari kwa ajili ya jeshi la Kristo.",
    "Three virgin sisters holding crosses, crowned together.": "Dada watatu mabikira wakishika misalaba, wakivikwa taji pamoja.",
    "Three wise men of the East presenting gold, frankincense, and myrrh before the Mother and Child, the wondrous star above the house.": "Wenye hekima watatu wa Mashariki wakitoa dhahabu, ubani na manemane mbele ya Mama na Mtoto, nyota ya ajabu juu ya nyumba.",
    "Three women of Caesarea in their solitary retreat at prayer, beseeching God for the peace of the Church, confessing Christ before the governor, crowned with martyrdom.": "Wanawake watatu wa Kaisaria katika mafichoni mwao ya upweke wakisali, wakimwomba Mungu kwa ajili ya amani ya Kanisa, wakimkiri Kristo mbele ya gavana, wakivikwa taji ya shahidi.",
    "Three young brothers crowned together at Lentini, Alphius silenced and beheaded, Philadelphus on the gridiron, Cyprian in the cauldron, their teacher Onesimus and their fellow martyrs gathered about them.": "Ndugu watatu wachanga wakivikwa taji pamoja huko Lentini, Alfio akinyamazishwa na kukatwa kichwa, Filadelfo juu ya chuma cha kuchomea, Kipriano katika sufuria, mwalimu wao Onesimo na mashahidi wenzao wamekusanyika kuwazunguka.",
    "Three young brothers on crosses, a holy woman crowned beside them, the betraying stepmother turned away.": "Ndugu watatu wachanga juu ya misalaba, mwanamke mtakatifu akivikwa taji kando yao, mama wa kambo msaliti akigeuzwa mbali.",
    "Three young courtiers of Lithuania hanged upon the sacred oak, the altar-table rising from its stump, their incorrupt relics enthroned at Vilnius before a generation had passed.": "Vijana watatu wa baraza la Lituania wakining'inizwa juu ya mwaloni mtakatifu, meza ya madhabahu ikiinuka kutoka shina lake, masalia yao yasiyooza yakiwekwa Vilnius kabla kizazi kimoja hakijapita.",
    "Three youths standing unburned in the furnace flames, a fourth figure like the Son of God in their midst, the angel of the dew overshadowing them.": "Vijana watatu wakisimama bila kuungua katika miali ya tanuru, sura ya nne kama Mwana wa Mungu katikati yao, malaika wa umande akiwafunika.",
    "Thyateira": "Thiatira",
    "Tikhvin": "Tikhvin",
    "Tiksna, Vologda, Russia": "Tiksna, Vologda, Urusi",
    "Timothy": "Timotheo",
})

