TEXT.update({
    "Tver lands": "Nchi za Tver",
    "Tver, Russia": "Tver, Urusi",
    "Tverdislov, Fool-for-Christ and Wonderworker of Rostov": "Tverdislov, Mpumbavu kwa ajili ya Kristo na Mtenda-Miujiza wa Rostov",
    "Twelve master builders receiving gold and an icon from the Mother of God at Blachernae, the great Dormition church rising above the Caves, their tools laid down for the habit.": "Wajenzi wakuu kumi na wawili wakipokea dhahabu na ikoni kutoka kwa Mzazi-Mungu huko Blakerne, kanisa kubwa la Kulala likiinuka juu ya Mapango, vifaa vyao vikiwekwa chini kwa ajili ya vazi la utawa.",
    "Two abbots in the schema holding a scroll or a model of their monastery.": "Maabate wawili katika shahada ya utawa wakishika gombo au kielelezo cha monasteri yao.",
    "Two apostles of the Seventy before the island of Corfu, the church of Stephen the Protomartyr rising, the maiden Kerkyra amid smoke and arrows, seven robbers and a governor in the waters of baptism.": "Mitume wawili wa Sabini mbele ya kisiwa cha Korfu, kanisa la Stefano Shahidi wa Kwanza likiinuka, bikira Kerkira katikati ya moshi na mishale, wanyang'anyi saba na gavana katika maji ya ubatizo.",
    "Two brothers, a priest and a deacon, building churches and casting down the idols across northern Italy, the island church of San Giulio rising on the lake.": "Ndugu wawili, kasisi na shemasi, wakijenga makanisa na kuangusha sanamu katika kaskazini yote ya Italia, kanisa la kisiwa la San Giulio likiinuka ziwani.",
    "Two deacons of Aphrodisias beneath the stones of their fellow citizens, the orarion of their service worn to the last, the city of the goddess answered by two crowns.": "Mashemasi wawili wa Afrodisia chini ya mawe ya wenzao wa mji, orario ya huduma yao ikivaliwa hadi mwisho, mji wa mungu wa kike ukijibiwa kwa taji mbili.",
    "Two elder monks and a soldier holding crosses, crowned as martyrs.": "Watawa wawili wazee na askari mmoja wakishika misalaba, wakivikwa taji ya shahidi.",
    "Two elders embracing or in prayer at a desert cave.": "Wazee wawili wakikumbatiana au wakisali kwenye pango la jangwani.",
    "Two founders of the Vologda wilderness slain in their monastery of the Holy Trinity, the raiders' swords about them, crowned as monk-martyrs, disciples of Saint Sergius.": "Waanzilishi wawili wa jangwa la Vologda waliouawa katika monasteri yao ya Utatu Mtakatifu, panga za wavamizi zikiwazunguka, wakivikwa taji kama mashahidi watawa, wanafunzi wa Mheshimiwa Sergio.",
    "Two founders settling on the island of Valaam in the great lake, the monastery rising in the frontier north, the Karelian people enlightened by their preaching.": "Waanzilishi wawili wakikaa katika kisiwa cha Valaam katika ziwa kubwa, monasteri ikiinuka katika kaskazini ya mpakani, watu wa Karelia wakiangazwa na mahubiri yao.",
    "Two hermits exchanging cells in the northern forest, the Ascension church rising by the Syanzhema river.": "Watawa wawili wa upweke wakibadilishana vyumba katika msitu wa kaskazini, kanisa la Kupaa likiinuka kando ya mto Syanzhema.",
    "Two hermits of the Syrian hills under the bare heavens, chains and herbs and unceasing prayer their common estate.": "Watawa wawili wa upweke wa vilima vya Shamu chini ya anga tupu, minyororo na mimea na sala isiyokoma vikiwa mali yao ya pamoja.",
    "Two hierarchs in white klobuks over an opened tomb, Hermogenes beholding their incorrupt relics.": "Maaskofu wawili katika klobuku nyeupe juu ya kaburi lililofunguliwa, Hermogene akiyaona masalia yao yasiyooza.",
    "Two holy women with scrolls, disciples of the apostles, in the far west of the world.": "Wanawake wawili watakatifu wenye magombo, wanafunzi wa mitume, katika magharibi ya mbali ya dunia.",
    "Two little brothers of the Novgorod land, taken in their innocence, glorified together, their incorrupt relics honored at Menyusha.": "Ndugu wawili wadogo wa nchi ya Novgorod, waliochukuliwa katika hali yao ya kutokuwa na hatia, wakitukuzwa pamoja, masalia yao yasiyooza yakiheshimiwa Menyusha.",
    "Two martyrs dragged behind wild horses, angels bearing their crowns.": "Mashahidi wawili wakiburutwa nyuma ya farasi wakali, malaika wakibeba taji zao.",
    "Two martyrs holding crosses, crowned for their contest.": "Mashahidi wawili wakishika misalaba, wakivikwa taji kwa mashindano yao.",
    "Two martyrs in chains and a senator visiting them in prison, all three crowned.": "Mashahidi wawili katika minyororo na seneta akiwatembelea gerezani, wote watatu wakivikwa taji.",
    "Two martyrs of the Persian land, the fire-altars they refused behind them, crowns descending.": "Mashahidi wawili wa nchi ya Persia, madhabahu za moto walizozikataa nyuma yao, taji zikishuka.",
    "Two martyrs on crosses at Amasea and a third awaiting his hour in prison, the Lord appearing to them with Theodore the Recruit amid a fragrance the tormentors could not smell.": "Mashahidi wawili juu ya misalaba huko Amasea na wa tatu akingoja saa yake gerezani, Bwana akiwatokea pamoja na Theodoro Askari Mpya katika harufu nzuri ambayo watesi hawakuiweza kuinusa.",
    "Two martyrs, an elder and a young man, holding crosses, the elder pierced with arrows.": "Mashahidi wawili, mzee na kijana, wakishika misalaba, mzee akitobolewa kwa mishale.",
    "Two martyrs, an elder and a youth, standing amid tame lions and unquenched flames, holding crosses.": "Mashahidi wawili, mzee na kijana, wakisimama kati ya simba waliofugwa na miali isiyozimwa, wakishika misalaba.",
    "Two monastic founders holding a church between them, the island of Valaam on Lake Ladoga behind.": "Waanzilishi wawili wa utawa wakishika kanisa kati yao, kisiwa cha Valaam katika Ziwa Ladoga nyuma.",
    "Two monastic founders holding a model of the Solovki monastery on its island in the White Sea.": "Waanzilishi wawili wa utawa wakishika kielelezo cha monasteri ya Solovki katika kisiwa chake katika Bahari Nyeupe.",
    "Two monks in a small boat amid the storm of the White Sea, their bodies borne incorrupt to the shore.": "Watawa wawili katika mashua ndogo katikati ya dhoruba ya Bahari Nyeupe, miili yao ikibebwa bila kuoza hadi ufuoni.",
    "Two monks in the schema at prayer in their caves.": "Watawa wawili katika shahada ya utawa wakisali katika mapango yao.",
    "Two monks in the schema, one pierced by an arrow, holding crosses.": "Watawa wawili katika shahada ya utawa, mmoja akitobolewa kwa mshale, wakishika misalaba.",
    "Two monks, one with a tame bear, the other holding a cloak.": "Watawa wawili, mmoja akiwa na dubu aliyefugwa, mwingine akishika joho.",
    "Two noblewomen of Rome gathering the bodies of the martyrs by night, the lamps of their burials answering Nero's fires, their own crowns descending under the sword.": "Wanawake wawili watukufu wa Roma wakikusanya miili ya mashahidi usiku, taa za mazishi yao zikijibu mioto ya Nero, taji zao wenyewe zikishuka chini ya upanga.",
    "Two nuns, mother and daughter, in prayer, angels singing above.": "Watawa wawili wa kike, mama na binti, wakisali, malaika wakiimba juu.",
    "Two physician-brothers with medicine boxes and spoons, their mother Theodota above them in prayer.": "Ndugu wawili matabibu wenye masanduku ya dawa na vijiko, mama yao Theodota juu yao akisali.",
    "Two physician-brothers with medicine boxes, their three brothers beside them, all crowned.": "Ndugu wawili matabibu wenye masanduku ya dawa, ndugu zao watatu kando yao, wote wakivikwa taji.",
    "Two presbyters rebuking the apostate emperor, then at prayer in the desert oasis as fire from heaven consumes the serpent's den.": "Makasisi wawili wakimkemea mfalme mwasi, kisha wakisali katika chemchemi ya jangwani huku moto kutoka mbinguni ukiteketeza pango la joka.",
    "Two recluses of Gaza unseen behind their walls, letters of counsel passing out through the abbot's hand to the whole world.": "Waliojitenga wawili wa Gaza wasioonekana nyuma ya kuta zao, barua za shauri zikitoka kupitia mkono wa abate hadi ulimwengu wote.",
    "Two righteous men side by side in the calendar as in life, their deeds kept whole in the memory of God.": "Watu wawili wenye haki bega kwa bega katika kalenda kama walivyokuwa katika maisha, matendo yao yakihifadhiwa mazima katika kumbukumbu ya Mungu.",
    "Two soldiers of the persecution halted on the road by a cloud of fire and a voice from heaven, opening the prisons they were sent to fill, standing at last in the flames themselves.": "Askari wawili wa mateso waliozuiliwa njiani na wingu la moto na sauti kutoka mbinguni, wakifungua magereza waliyotumwa kuyajaza, wakisimama mwishowe katika miali wenyewe.",
    "Two soldiers stepping from the ranks as George stands whole beside the shattered wheel, their confession made in the first instant and their crowns received the same hour.": "Askari wawili wakitoka safuni huku Georgi akisimama mzima kando ya gurudumu lililovunjika, ukiri wao ukifanywa mara moja na taji zao kupokelewa saa ileile.",
    "Two twin brothers holding crosses, often with horses of which they are patrons.": "Ndugu wawili mapacha wakishika misalaba, mara nyingi wakiwa na farasi ambao ni walinzi wao.",
})

